# RustDesk Server (hbbs + hbbr) requires no customer-supplied configuration.
# hbbs generates its own ed25519 keypair on first start and writes it to the
# data volume (/opt/rustdesk/data). No credentials are set here.
#
# After installation, retrieve the public key to configure your RustDesk clients:
#   docker exec $(docker ps -qf name=hbbs) cat /root/id_ed25519.pub
